-// causal_conv1d.cpp — PTO-ISA depthwise causal conv1d + bias + (opt) SiLU.
-//
-// Drop-in for sgl's AscendC causal_conv1d, written on the PTO tile ISA (like
-// csrc/mega_chunk_gdn). Same op:
